title: "greenhouse-temperature-humidity-forecasting"
abstract: "Data, reproducible notebooks, quality-control outputs, and figures supporting multi-resolution and multi-horizon forecasting of greenhouse air temperature and relative humidity. The repository documents sensor evaluation, data validation, four-minute temporal regularization, and subsequent forecasting analyses."
